#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/07_theatre_of_hvar/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Find them and bring them to Hvar before the opening night!"
msgstr "¡Encontradlos y traedlos a Hvar antes del estreno!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/07_theatre_of_hvar/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Aga's men said a jester is a useless man."
